{"unit_id":"gnk478__dsh-client-ui-wallpaper#feature-1","repo":"gnk478/dsh-client-ui-wallpaper","commit":"d18ebee69fc5c5fab09865ab46c0dd909fad1f57","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-wallpaper 的功能「图片与视频背景」：把素材目录中的壁纸铺到 DSH 客户端窗口背景。设置面板可选择静态图片，也可切换同名动态视频。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:21-35","lib/client.js:1100-1140"]}
