{"unit_id":"gnk478__dsh-client-ui-wallpaper#feature-3","repo":"gnk478/dsh-client-ui-wallpaper","commit":"d18ebee69fc5c5fab09865ab46c0dd909fad1f57","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-wallpaper 的功能「外观调节」：设置面板提供背景模糊、面板与侧栏透明度控制，并可根据背景亮度自动调整文字颜色。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:374-396","lib/client.js:850-920","lib/client.js:1036-1060"]}
