{"unit_id":"gnk478__dsh-client-ui-wallpaper#caveat-1","repo":"gnk478/dsh-client-ui-wallpaper","commit":"d18ebee69fc5c5fab09865ab46c0dd909fad1f57","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-wallpaper 使用前须知：播放列表同步读取 macOS Dynamic Wallpaper.app 的容器目录，需要给 DSH 完全磁盘访问权限；该功能依赖系统目录与本机素材。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:37-39","lib/client.js:1270-1360"]}
{"unit_id":"gnk478__dsh-client-ui-wallpaper#caveat-2","repo":"gnk478/dsh-client-ui-wallpaper","commit":"d18ebee69fc5c5fab09865ab46c0dd909fad1f57","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-wallpaper 使用前须知：视频缩略图调用 macOS 的 /usr/bin/qlmanage，并把缩略图缓存写入 ~/.dsh/wallpaper-thumbs，适用于具备该系统工具的环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:143-160"]}
